# output, decks read byte for byte): check them out exactly as committed,
# never with line-ending conversion. Without this, Git for Windows'
# default core.autocrlf=true turns LF goldens into CRLF and the printout
# comparisons fail on a Windows checkout (11-17, Windows Python level-3
# certification of razor_pair_reuse: test_the_flag_off_printout_is_unchanged).
tests/fixtures/** -text
